# Laravel Nova Context

## Official Nova Docs
Always refer to:
- https://nova.laravel.com/docs/v4
- Current version: 4.x

## Usage
This application uses **Laravel Nova (v4)** as the only admin dashboard.

All admin functionality — including CRUD, filtering, metrics, and custom tools — is handled exclusively through Nova Resources located in `App\Nova`.

## Nova Structure
- Resources: `App\Nova\*`
- Actions: `App\Nova\Actions\*`
- Metrics: `App\Nova\Metrics\*`
- Lenses: `App\Nova\Lenses\*`
- Custom Tools: `nova-components/*`

## Example Fields
```php
Text::make('Title')->sortable()->rules('required'),
BelongsTo::make('Category'),
Select::make('Status')->options([
  'draft' => 'Draft',
  'published' => 'Published'
])->displayUsingLabels(),